  "changelog": "0.3.7\n- New: the Speaker, Microphone and Camera tabs each have a Device picker. Leave it on Automatic and Slime OS detects the right one; switch it when detection guesses wrong — e.g. a webcam's built-in microphone getting used instead of your real mic.\n- The Speaker and Microphone choices carry into your Brain sessions too. The Camera choice sets which camera the local preview shows (a Brain still sees every connected camera).\n- Each tab now shows which device is actually in use, even with nothing to change.",
